/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=Archmage%20Arlinn%20Kord%20thrust,into%20Rembert%27s%20outstretched%20arms.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e17","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Devils yank on Olaylie's wings, bringing her crashing to the ground.","participants":["devils","olaylie"],"location":"havengul","importance":"minor","page":"stories/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","order":513,"story_date":"2016-06-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":84,"quote":"In unison, they heaved back, yanking on the angel's wings, sending Olaylie plummeting to the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=In%20unison%2C%20they%20heaved,plummeting%20to%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Archmage of Goldnight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=In%20unison%2C%20they%20heaved,plummeting%20to%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e18","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Devils pin Arlinn as she prays to Avacyn and receives no answer.","participants":["arlinn-kord","devils","avacyn"],"location":"havengul","importance":"major","page":"stories/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","order":513,"story_date":"2016-06-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"She waited, opening herself to the power of the protector; she needed power to save the angel.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=She%20waited%2C%20opening%20herself,to%20save%20the%20angel.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Archmage of Goldnight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=She%20waited%2C%20opening%20herself,to%20save%20the%20angel.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e19","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Olaylie's agonized cry makes Arlinn lose herself and transform into a werewolf.","participants":["arlinn-kord","olaylie"],"location":"havengul","importance":"major","page":"stories/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","order":513,"story_date":"2016-06-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":91,"quote":"Arlinn felt the power of the pain in Olaylie's cry, and just like the night, she came apart.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=Arlinn%20felt%20the%20power,night%2C%20she%20came%20apart.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Archmage of Goldnight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08#:~:text=Arlinn%20felt%20the%20power,night%2C%20she%20came%20apart.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Archmage of Goldnight\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"archmage-goldnight-2016-06-08-e20","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: The werewolf tears into the devils.","par